  "notes": "FORMATION:\n{観|かん} (view, watch) + {覧|らん} (look at, see) → watch and view\n\nVERB FORM:\n{観覧|かんらん}する (to view, to watch)\n\nRELATED COMPOUNDS:\n- {観覧車|かんらんしゃ} (Ferris wheel - literally \"viewing wheel\")\n- {観覧料|かんらんりょう} (admission fee)\n- {観覧席|かんらんせき} (spectator seats)\n- {一般|いっぱん}{観覧|かんらん} (public viewing/admission)\n\nRELATED WORDS:\n- {鑑賞|かんしょう} (appreciation, viewing - for art/music)\n- {見学|けんがく} (observation visit, tour)\n- {観戦|かんせん} (watching a game/match)\n\nDISTINCTION:\n{観覧|かんらん} is a general term for viewing. {鑑賞|かんしょう} implies appreciation with deeper engagement (art, music). {見学|けんがく} implies a learning or educational purpose. {観戦|かんせん} is specifically for sports.",
